# src/ root: generated outputs mixed in with scripts.
# ~900 loose files. .asv/.tmp/.log/logs/ excluded above
# (unambiguously disposable). This block handles the rest:
# deny-all in src/ root, then allowlist exactly the files
# confirmed load-bearing by docs/SRC_LoadBearingAllowlist_v001.md
# (traced from PaperDraft_IdentifiabilitySkeleton_v002.md's own
# citations, cross-checked via matlab.codetools.requiredFilesAndProducts
# and prior-session history, 2026-08-25). src/functions/, src/utils/,
# src/req/, src/tests/ are untouched by this block (kept in full,
# already confirmed small/genuine toolkit); src/results/ and
# src/obsolete/ already covered by existing rules elsewhere in this
# file. Anything in src/ root NOT listed below is presumed dead
# (superseded version, one-off exploratory/check/test/diagnose
# script, or stray junk) -- see Part E's own doc for the two open
# items not yet fully resolved (the other six datasets' noise
# characterisation files, included below by extension per Dagmar;
# xu/bootstrap noise-model variants beyond shaped_xu, NOT yet
# resolved and NOT included below pending that check).
# ============================================
